# Copy to .pre-publish-patterns (git-ignored) and replace the placeholders with your own strings.
# One extended regular expression per line; matched case-insensitively against every tracked and
# untracked file by scripts/scan-personal.sh. Never commit the real file.
#
# Your names and nicknames (first, last, with and without diacritics)
Firstname Lastname
lastname
# Employer, school, gym or club names
Example Employer Ltd
# Street, city district or other address fragments
Example Street 12
# Hostnames, domains and device names you use
my-home-server
example-private-domain\.net
# Personal e-mail domains, phone number fragments, account number fragments
@personal-mail\.example
\+000 000 000 000
